---
<section id="assistant" style="padding:5rem 2rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;text-align:center;">
  <!-- Purple radial background glow -->
  <div style="position:absolute;top:-40px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:100%;max-width:750px;height:160px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 40% at 50% 0%, rgba(139,92,246,0.08), transparent 70%);pointer-events:none;z-index:0;"></div>
  
  <div style="max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:3rem;text-align:center;">
    
    <!-- 1. "It's not just deployment." Centered Header & Subtext matching nixora.co.in -->
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:1.25rem;width:100%;text-align:center;">
      <h2 class="section-headline" style="text-align:center;">
        It's not just <span class="accent">deployment.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-para" style="text-align:center;margin:0 auto;max-width:640px;">
        Deployment is the first capability, not the product. Nixora is the control plane for AI-generated software and AI agents: deploy and diagnose today, agent-native access through MCP next, and over time monitoring, scaling, governance, and multi-agent systems, all managed in one place.
      </p>

      <!-- Two-column "TODAY / NIXORA'S DIRECTION" comparison panel -->
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.5rem;width:100%;margin-top:0.75rem;text-align:left;" class="direction-grid">
        
        <!-- TODAY Column -->
        <div style="background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #1f1f1f;border-radius:12px;padding:1.75rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);">
          <div style="font-family:'Fira Code',monospace;font-size:0.75rem;color:#71717a;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">TODAY</div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:0;">Deploy & Diagnose</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.6;color:#a1a1aa;margin:0;">
            Go from AI-generated code to a live, running application in seconds. Diagnose why an AI-generated deployment failed and what to change.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- NIXORA'S DIRECTION Column -->
        <div style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.04) 0%, #0d0d0d 100%);border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,0.35);border-radius:12px;padding:1.75rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);">
          <div style="font-family:'Fira Code',monospace;font-size:0.75rem;color:#a78bfa;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">NIXORA'S DIRECTION</div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#a78bfa;margin:0;">Control Plane for AI Software</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.6;color:#a1a1aa;margin:0;">
            Agent-native deployment target via MCP, multi-agent access with per-agent permissions, deep monitoring, autonomous scaling, and multi-agent system governance.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .direction-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }
  }
</style>
